   "url": "https://x.com/Steelersdepot/status/2104193920586612837",
   "text": "PPG's Gerry Dulac questions if CB Joey Porter Jr.ever  will play again for the Steelers: \u201cThey would like to have Joey Porter Jr., just because it enhances their depth. He's just another solid player on their defense. We'll see what happens this week, as we say every week. I'm a little skeptical about everything because I don't understand, after everything Joey Porter Jr. has done, if he would then go out on the field and play, everything he did in OTAs, minicamp, and now in training camp, was for naught. He would go out and play for nearly $4 million when he turned his back on just north of $27 million. It doesn't make sense to me.\u201d #Steelers #NFL",
